LICENSE — PENDING SUPERVISOR CONFIRMATION

The licence for this repository has not yet been chosen.

Two decisions are required before the first public release:

1. CODE licence — for scripts in scripts/, src/, and tests/.
   Common choice for research code: MIT or Apache-2.0.

2. DATA licence — for the dataset in data/final/.
   Common choice for research datasets: CC-BY-4.0.

Note that source documents remain the property of their publishers. This
repository does not relicense them. Where redistribution rights are unclear,
only metadata, URLs, checksums, and extraction scripts are stored.

Replace this file with the chosen licence text before tagging v0.9.0.
